{"title":"DNA Extraction","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"DNA Extraction"},"headingText":"Overview","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n\nLearn how to extract DNA from cells using simple household materials Read through the material below and then watch the presentation.\n\n[→ View the slides](slides.qmd)\n\n## Key Vocabulary\n\n\n::: {.vocab-box}\n**Extraction solution** — A mixture of salt, water, and detergent that breaks down cell and nuclear membranes\n:::\n\n::: {.vocab-box}\n**Precipitation** — When DNA comes out of solution and becomes visible\n:::\n\n::: {.vocab-box}\n**Detergent** — A substance that dissolves lipids, breaking down the fatty membranes around cells\n:::\n\n::: {.vocab-box}\n**Salting out** — Using salt to make DNA clump together and separate from water\n:::\n\n::: {.vocab-box}\n**Sample preparation** — Breaking down tissue or cells into smaller pieces\n:::\n\n::: {.vocab-box}\n**Filtration** — Removing solid debris from the liquid solution\n:::\n\n\n## Quick Check — Live Quiz {.center}\n\n::: {.qr-block}\n<img src=\"https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=180x180&data=REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_GOOGLE_FORM_LINK\" alt=\"QR code to join the live quiz\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\">\n\n::: {}\n**DNA Extraction — 3 questions**\n\n1. Why is detergent used in DNA extraction?\n2. What happens to DNA when it precipitates out of solution?\n3. What role does salt play in the extraction process?\n\n[Or open the quiz directly →](REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_GOOGLE_FORM_LINK)\n:::\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n## Overview\n\nLearn how to extract DNA from cells using simple household materials Read through the material below and then watch the presentation.\n\n[→ View the slides](slides.qmd)\n\n## Key Vocabulary\n\n\n::: {.vocab-box}\n**Extraction solution** — A mixture of salt, water, and detergent that breaks down cell and nuclear membranes\n:::\n\n::: {.vocab-box}\n**Precipitation** — When DNA comes out of solution and becomes visible\n:::\n\n::: {.vocab-box}\n*